Hello, dear friends!
We are glad to reveal, what’ve been preparing for the new Halloween Mysteries update:
-Revised battle system
- Put the finishing touches to the plot to make you dig into the game atmosphere;
-Revised the game levels;
-Improved the game interface;
-Added Steam trading cards!
And of course, we haven’t forgotten of Chinese and German localizations, and we are getting them ready too!
Please let us know If you have any suggestions or recommendations!

