Hello, dear friends! We’ve just released a new update specially for you.
What’s in it?
     
[list]
    [*]We’ve worked on the optimization of locations;
    [*]Fixed a lot of bugs in the enemies’ behavior;
    [*]Added some bonus levels in the game (you’ll have to find them if you want to play them);
    [*]Added the achievements;
    [*]Still working on game balance;
    [*]Fixed some minor bugs;
[/list] 
Your feedback will still help us a lot!
Have fun in Halloween Mysteries!

