Hello, pumpkins!
We’re very happy to get your feedback, and we are ready to present our new update to Halloween Mysteries. Here is what’ve done so far:
-Changed the camera behavior;
-Added health bars to enemies;
-Better map, now you can zoom and rotate it;
-Added resolution option in the settings menu;
-Rebalanced the enemies and levels;
-Fixed some minor bugs;

What we are going to do next?
-Co-op game (hotseat)
-German and Chinese localizations (subtitles for both)
-Steam cards and achievements

